nnocenza del suo cliente, è disposto a tutto pur di fargli vincere il processo in corte d’assise, ritrovando in questo modo il senso della sua vocazione.","tagline":"Sembrava un caso semplice"},{"language":"en-US","title":"An Ordinary Case","overview":"Jean Monier is a disillusioned lawyer, appointed to defend Nicolas Milik, a man accused of murdering his wife. While everything points to his guilt, Monier takes up the case, convinced of his innocence."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Depuis qu’il a fait innocenter un meurtrier récidiviste, Maître Jean Monier ne prend plus de dossiers criminels. La rencontre avec Nicolas Milik, père de famille accusé du meurtre de sa femme, le touche et fait vaciller ses certitudes. Convaincu de l’innocence de son client, il est prêt à tout pour lui faire gagner son procès aux assises, retrouvant ainsi le sens de sa vocation."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sgvx7ft4bLW13WjYeD6aaWKJQqJ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sgvx7ft4bLW13WjYeD6aaWKJQqJ.png","language":"it","width":4000,"height":460},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nhmm0b8LD3MC8QrnHdO4hBHQRal.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nhmm0b8LD3MC8QrnHdO4hBHQRal.png","language":"en","width":1199,"height":256},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hXe8VuRGUpfO5lRTI4X50ez4gZh.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hXe8VuRGUpfO5lRTI4X50ez4gZh.png","language":"fr","width":1823,"height":215}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fBS8GPeaAxA85TMICRuXKtwE8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fBS8GPeaAxA85TMICRuXKtwE8.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Wd6XFMUAALo6O4fglGrS6QxxjS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Wd6XFMUAALo6O4fglGrS6QxxjS.jpg","language":"it","width":720,"height":1080},{"type":"poster","url":"http